o damages for loss of goodwill,\n      work stoppage, computer failure or malfunction, or any and all\n      other commercial damages or losses), even if such Contributor\n      has been advised of the possibility of such damages.\n\n   9. Accepting Warranty or Additional Liability. While redistributing\n      the Work or Derivative Works thereof, You may choose to offer,\n      and charge a fee for, acceptance of support, warranty, indemnity,\n      or other liability obligations and/or rights consistent with this\n      License. However, in accepting such obligations, You may act only\n      on Your own behalf and on Your sole responsibility, not on behalf\n      of any other Contributor, and only if You agree to indemnify,\n      defend, and hold each Contributor harmless for any liability\n      incurred by, or claims asserted against, such Contributor by reason\n      of your accepting any such warranty or additional liability.\n\n   END OF TERMS AND CONDITIONS\n\n   APPENDIX: How to apply the Apache License to your work.\n\n      To apply the Apache License to your work, attach the following\n      boilerplate notice, with the fields enclosed by brackets \"{}\"\n      replaced with your own identifying information. (Don't include\n      the brackets!)  The text should be enclosed in the appropriate\n      comment syntax for the file format. We also recommend that a\n      file or class name and description of purpose be included on the\n      same \"printed page\" as the copyright notice for easier\n      identification within third-party archives.\n\n   Copyright {yyyy} {name of copyright owner}\n\n   Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (the \"License\");\n   you may not use this file except in compliance with the License.\n   You may obtain a copy of the License at\n\n       http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\n\n   Unless required by applicable law or agreed to in writing, software\n   distributed under the License is distributed on an \"AS IS\" BASIS,\n   WITHOUT WARRANTIES OR CONDITIONS OF ANY KIND, either express or implied.\n   See the License for the specific language governing permissions and\n   limitations under the License.\n",
  "modules": {
    "manage.html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover\">\n  <title>Kotatsu 漫画源管理</title>\n  <style>\n    :root{color-scheme:light dark;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;--accent:#176b52;--line:#d8dfdb;--soft:#f3f7f5;--danger:#9a3f4b}\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}[hidden]{display:none!important}body{margin:0;padding:calc(18px + env(safe-area-inset-top)) 16px calc(28px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));background:#fff;color:#17211d}\n    main{max-width:860px;margin:auto}.card{padding:16px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;background:var(--soft);margin-bottom:14px}\n    h1{font-size:24px;margin:0 0 8px}p{line-height:1.55;margin:6px 0}.muted{color:#64706b;font-size:13px}.warn{color:var(--danger)}\n    .toolbar{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px;margin-top:12px}.filters{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:9px;margin-bottom:10px}\n    input[type=search],input[type=email],input[type=text],input[type=password],select,button{min-height:42px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px;background:#fff;color:inherit;font:inherit;padding:0 12px}\n    button{cursor:pointer;font-weight:650}button.primary{background:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent);color:#fff}button:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:wait}\n    .summary{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:10px 2px}.source-list{display:grid;gap:7px;max-height:58vh;overflow:auto}\n    .source{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:10px 11px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:#fff}\n    .source strong{display:block;font-size:14px}.source small{display:block;color:#64706b;margin-top:2px}.badge{font-size:11px;padding:3px 7px;border-radius:999px;background:#e7eee9;white-space:nowrap}.badge.adult{background:#f6e5e8;color:#842d3a}\n    #status{min-height:22px;margin-top:11px;font-size:13px;white-space:pre-wrap}.adult-switch{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:12px}\n    .login-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:7px}.login-actions button{min-height:34px;font-size:12px}.login-state{font-size:12px;color:#64706b}\n    .source-option{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;margin-top:10px}.source-option input{margin:3px 0 0;flex:none}.source-option span{display:grid;gap:3px}\n    @media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root{--line:#3a4741;--soft:#1b2520}body{background:#111915;color:#edf4f0}input[type=search],select,button,.source{background:#202b25}.badge{background:#33443a}.badge.adult{background:#4a2d33;color:#ffdbe1}}\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n  <section class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Kotatsu 漫画源</h1>\n    <p>首次安装默认启用中文和多语言漫画源；普通漫画与成人漫画都可按需调整。</p>\n    <p id=\"source-summary\" class=\"muted\"></p>\n    <label class=\"adult-switch\"><input id=\"adult-enabled\" type=\"checkbox\" checked> 在搜索和发现中启用已选择的成人漫画源</label>\n    <div class=\"toolbar\">\n      <button id=\"save\" class=\"primary\">保存已选源</button>\n      <button id=\"authorize-selected\">保存并一次授权已选</button>\n      <button id=\"authorize-all\">一次授权全部域名</button>\n    </div>\n    <div id=\"status\" role=\"status\"></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"filters\">\n      <input id=\"filter\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"搜索名称、语言或源 ID\" aria-label=\"筛选漫画源\">\n      <select id=\"kind-filter\" aria-label=\"内容分级\">\n        <option value=\"all\">全部</option>\n        <option value=\"normal\">普通漫画</option>\n        <option value=\"adult\">成人漫画</option>\n      </select>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"toolbar\">\n      <button id=\"defaults\">恢复推荐源</button>\n      <button id=\"select-all\">全选已适配源</button>\n      <button id=\"select-visible\">全选当前筛选</button>\n      <button id=\"clear\">清空选择</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"summary\"><strong id=\"selection-count\"></strong><span id=\"visible-count\" class=\"muted\"></span></div>\n    <div id=\"sources\" class=\"source-list\"></div>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"card\">\n    <h2>Keiyoushi 扩展仓库</h2>\n    <p id=\"repository-summary\" class=\"muted\"></p>\n    <p class=\"muted\">仓库清单随插件更新。已关联项目使用现有 Kotatsu 解析器，不重复添加源；其余待移植，不能直接运行 Android 扩展。</p>\n    <input id=\"repository-filter\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"筛选仓库名称、语言或包名\" aria-label=\"筛选 Keiyoushi 仓库\">\n    <div id=\"repository-list\" class=\"source-list\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"></div>\n    <button id=\"repository-more\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">显示更多</button>\n  </section>\n</main>\n<script>\n  'use strict';\n  // Shared by the JSVM data module and the plugin management page. Passwords are never persisted.\nfunction createKotatsuAccounts(bridge) {\n  const pending = new Map();\n  const key = login => 'kotatsu-comic:account:' + login.family;\n  async function request(url, body, headers) {\n    const response = await bridge.http.fetch({url, method:'POST', headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json',...headers},\n      body:JSON.stringify(body), responseType:'text', followRedirects:false, timeoutMs:20000});\n    let data;try { data=typeof response.body==='string'?JSON.parse(response.body):response.body; } catch (_) {}\n    // Do not echo server bodies: they can contain credentials or personally identifying information.\n    if(response.status!==200||!data||typeof data!=='object'||data.error)throw new Error('账号认证失败，请检查账号、密码或登录有效期');\n    return data;\n  }\n  function session(login, data, guest=false) {\n    const access=login.mode==='firebase'?(data.idToken||data.id_token):data.access_token;\n    const refresh=login.mode==='firebase'?(data.refreshToken||data.refresh_token):data.refresh_token;\n    const seconds=Number(data.expiresIn||data.expires_in||3600);\n    if(typeof access!=='string'||!access||typeof refresh!=='string'||!refresh||!Number.isFinite(seconds)||seconds<=0)throw new Error('账号认证未返回有效令牌');\n    return {access,refresh,expiresAt:Date.now()+Math.min(seconds,86400)*1000,guest};\n  }\n  async function signIn(login,email,password) {\n    if(!email||!password)throw new Error('请输入账号和密码');\n    if(login.mode==='vomic') {\n      if(!/^https:\\/\\/api\\.vomicmh\\.com\\/pics$/.test(login.authBase||''))throw new Error('vomic 登录地址无效');\n      const response=await bridge.http.fetch({url:login.authBase+'/login',method:'POST',\n        headers:{'Content-Type':'application/x-www-form-urlencoded'},\n        body:'identity='+encodeURIComponent(email)+'&password='+encodeURIComponent(password),\n        responseType:'text',followRedirects:false,timeoutMs:20000});\n      let data;try{data=typeof response.body==='string'?JSON.parse(response.body):response.body;}catch(_){}\n      if(response.status!==200||Number(data&&data.code)!==200||typeof data.token!=='string'||!data.token)throw new Error('vomic 账号认证失败，请检查账号和密码');\n      const saved={access:data.token,expiresAt:0,guest:false};\n      await bridge.storage.set(key(login),saved);return saved;\n    }\n    const url=login.mode==='firebase'?login.authBase+'/verifyPassword?key='+login.publicKey:login.authBase+'/token?grant_type=password';\n    const data=await request(url,login.mode==='firebase'?{email,password,returnSecureToken:true}:{email,password,gotrue_meta_security:{}},login.mode==='supabase'?{apikey:login.publicKey}:{});\n    const saved=session(login,data);await bridge.storage.set(key(login),saved);return saved;\n  }\n  async function token(login) {\n    const cacheKey=key(login);if(pending.has(cacheKey))return pending.get(cacheKey);\n    const job=(async()=>{\n      const old=await bridge.storage.get(cacheKey);\n      if(login.mode==='vomic') {\n        if(old&&typeof old.access==='string'&&old.access)return old.access;\n        throw new Error('请先在插件管理页登录 vomic 账号');\n      }\n      if(old&&typeof old.access==='string'&&old.access&&Number(old.expiresAt)>Date.now()+60000)return old.access;\n      if(!old||!old.refresh) {\n        if(login.mode==='supabase')return login.publicKey;\n        // The publisher supports one anonymous Firebase session. Persist/reuse it; never rotate identities to evade limits.\n        if(login.mode!=='firebase')throw new Error('请在插件管理页登录');\n        const data=await request(login.authBase+'/signupNewUser?key='+login.publicKey,{returnSecureToken:true},{});\n        const saved=session(login,data,true);await bridge.storage.set(cacheKey,saved);return saved.access;\n      }\n      const url=login.mode==='firebase'?login.refreshUrl+'?key='+login.publicKey:login.authBase+'/token?grant_type=refresh_token';\n      const data=await request(url,login.mode==='firebase'?{grant_type:'refresh_token',refresh_token:old.refresh}:{refresh_token:old.refresh},login.mode==='supabase'?{apikey:login.publicKey}:{});\n      const saved=session(login,data,old.guest===true),current=await bridge.storage.get(cacheKey);\n      // A logout/new login while refresh was in flight must win.\n      if(!current||current.refresh!==old.refresh)throw new Error('登录状态已改变，请重试');\n      await bridge.storage.set(cacheKey,saved);return saved.access;\n    })();\n    pending.set(cacheKey,job);try{return await job;}finally{pending.delete(cacheKey);}\n  }\n  return {signIn,token,read:login=>bridge.storage.get(key(login)),clear:login=>bridge.storage.set(key(login),null)};\n}\n\n  let accounts;\n  function accountStore(){return accounts||(accounts=createKotatsuAccounts(FishReader));}\n  const SOURCES = [{\"id\":\"hentai3:all\",\"title\":\"3Hentai\",\"language\":\"all\",\"adult\":true,\"supported\":true,\"domains\":[\"3hentai.net\",\"*.3hentai.net\"],\"login\":null,\"domain\":\"3hentai.net\"},{\"id\":\"acgxmh:zh\",\"title\":\"ACG漫画网\",\"language\":\"zh\",\"adult\":true,\"supported\":true,\"domains\":[\"www.acgxmh.com\",\"*.acgnngca.com\"],\"login\":null,\"domain\":\"www.acgxmh.com\"},{\"id\":\"asmhentai:all\",\"title\":\"AsmHentai\",\"language\":\"all\",\"adult\":true,\"supported\":true,\"domains\":[\"asmhentai.com\",\"*.asmhentai.com\"],\"login\":null,\"domain\":\"asmhentai.com\"},{\"id\":\"buondua:all\",\"title\":\"Buondua\",\"language\":\"all\",\"adult\":true,\"supported\":true,\"domains\":[\"buondua.com\",\"*.buondua.com\"],\"login\":null,\"domain\":\"buondua.com\"},{\"id\":\"ccc_:zh\",\"title\":\"CCC追漫台\",\"language\":\"zh\",\"adult\":false,\"supported\":true,\"domains\":[\"www.creative-comic.tw\",\"api.creative-comic.tw\",\"storage.googleapis.com\"],\"login\":null,\"domain\":\"www.creative-comic.tw\"},{\"id\":\"goda:zh\",\"title\":\"GoDa漫画\",\"language\":\"zh\",\"adult\":false,\"supported\":true,\"domains\":[\"godamh.com\",\"v2.apikk.top\",\"c-nd2-1.6wm.top\",\"c-nd3-1.6wm.top\",\"*.6wm.top\"],\"login\":null,\"domain\":\"godamh.com\"},{\"id\":\"hcomic:zh\",\"title\":\"H-Comic\",\"language\":\"zh\",\"adult\":true,\"supported\":true,\"domains\":[\"h-comic.com\",\"h-comic.link\",\"api.h-comic.com\"],\"login\":null,\"domain\":\"h-comic.com\"},{\"id\":\"hanman18:zh\",\"title\":\"Hanman18\",\"language\":\"zh\",\"adult\":true,\"supported\":true,\"domains\":[\"hanman18.com\",\"*.hanman18.com\"],\"login\":null,\"domain\":\"hanman18.com\"},{\"id\":\"hentaicosplay:all\",\"title\":\"HentaiCosplay\",\"language\":\"all\",\"adult\":true,\"supported\":true,\"domains\":[\"hentai-cosplay-xxx.com\",\"*.hentai-cosplay-xxx.com\"],\"login\":null,\"domain\":\"hentai-cosplay-xxx.com\"},{\"id\":\"hentaienvy:all\",\"title\":\"HentaiEnvy\",\"language\":\"all\",\"adult\":true,\"supported\":true,\"domains\":[\"hentaienvy.com\",\"*.hentaienvy.com\"],\"login\":null,\"domain\":\"hentaienvy.com\"},{\"id\":\"hentaiera:all\",\"title\":\"HentaiEra\",\"language\":\"all\",\"adult\":true,\"supported\":true,\"domains\":[\"hentaiera.com\",\"*.hentaiera.com\"],\"login\":null,\"domain\":\"hentaiera.com\"},{\"id\":\"hentairox:all\",\"title\":\"HentaiRox\",\"language\":\"all\",\"adult\":true,\"supported\":true,\"domains\":[\"hentairox.com\",\"*.hentairox.com\"],\"login\":null,\"domain\":\"hentairox.com\"},{\"id\":\"holoearth:all\",\"title\":\"HoloEarth\",\"language\":\"all\",\"adult\":false,\"supported\":true,\"domains\":[\"holoearth.com\"],\"login\":null,\"domain\":\"holoearth.com\"},{\"id\":\"kiutaku:all\",\"title\":\"Kiutaku\",\"language\":\"all\",\"adult\":false,\"supported\":true,\"domains\":[\"kiutaku.com\",\"mitaku.net\",\"*.mitaku.net\",\"*.kiutaku.com\"],\"login\":null,\"domain\":\"kiutaku.com\"},{\"id\":\"komiic:zh\",\"title\":\"Komiic\",\"language\":\"zh\",\"adult\":false,\"supported\":true,\"domains\":[\"komiic.cc\",\"public.komiic.cc\",\"public.komiic.com\"],\"login\":{\"url\":\"https://komiic.cc/login\",\"cookieUrls\":[\"https://komiic.cc/\"],\"cookieNames\":[\"token\",\"komiic-access-token\"],\"scheme\":\"Bearer\",\"apiHosts\":[\"komiic.cc\"],\"apiPathPrefix\":\"/api/\",\"family\":\"komiic:zh\"},\"domain\":\"komiic.cc\"},{\"id\":\"mahoushoujobu:all\",\"title\":\"MahouShoujobu\",\"language\":\"all\",\"adult\":false,\"supported\":true,\"domains\":[\"mahoushoujobu.com\"],\"login\":null,\"domain\":\"mahoushoujobu.com\"},{\"id\":\"manga18fx:all\",\"title\":\"Manga18Fx\",\"language\":\"all\",\"adult\":true,\"supported\":true,\"domains\":[\"manga18fx.com\",\"*.manga18fx.com\"],\"login\":null,\"domain\":\"manga18fx.com\"},{\"id\":\"mangacrazy:all\",\"title\":\"MangaCrazy\",\"language\":\"all\",\"adult\":true,\"supported\":true,\"domains\":[\"mangacrazy.net\",\"cdn.mangadistrict.com\"],\"login\":null,\"domain\":\"mangacrazy.net\"},{\"id\":\"mangadex:all\",\"title\":\"MangaDex\",\"language\":\"all\",\"adult\":false,\"supported\":true,\"domains\":[\"mangadex.org\",\"api.mangadex.org\",\"uploads.mangadex.org\",\"*.mangadex.network\"],\"login\":null,\"domain\":\"mangadex.org\"},{\"id\":\"manhwa18cc:all\",\"title\":\"Manhwa18.cc\",\"language\":\"all\",\"adult\":true,\"supported\":true,\"domains\":[\"manhwa18.cc\",\"*.manhwa18.cc\"],\"login\":null,\"domain\":\"manhwa18.cc\"},{\"id\":\"manhwa210:all\",\"title\":\"Manhwa210\",\"language\":\"all\",\"adult\":false,\"supported\":true,\"domains\":[\"manhwa210.com\",\"*.manhwa210.com\"],\"login\":null,\"domain\":\"manhwa210.com\"},{\"id\":\"misskon:all\",\"title\":\"MissKon\",\"language\":\"all\",\"adult\":false,\"supported\":true,\"domains\":[\"misskon.com\",\"*.misskon.com\"],\"login\":null,\"domain\":\"misskon.com\"},{\"id\":\"multporn:all\",\"title\":\"Multporn\",\"language\":\"all\",\"adult\":true,\"supported\":true,\"domains\":[\"multporn.net\"],\"login\":null,\"domain\":\"multporn.net\"},{\"id\":\"nhentai:all\",\"title\":\"nhentai\",\"language\":\"all\",\"adult\":true,\"supported\":true,\"domains\":[\"nhentai.net\",\"*.nhentai.net\"],\"login\":null,\"domain\":\"nhentai.net\"},{\"id\":\"nhentai_xxx:all\",\"title\":\"NHentai.xxx\",\"language\":\"all\",\"adult\":true,\"supported\":true,\"domains\":[\"nhentai.xxx\",\"*.nhentaimg.com\",\"*.nhentai.xxx\"],\"login\":null,\"domain\":\"nhentai.xxx\"},{\"id\":\"projectsuki:all\",\"title\":\"Project Suki\",\"language\":\"all\",\"adult\":false,\"supported\":true,\"domains\":[\"projectsuki.com\"],\"login\":null,\"domain\":\"projectsuki.com\"},{\"id\":\"sexkomix:all\",\"title\":\"Sexkomix\",\"language\":\"all\",\"adult\":true,\"supported\":true,\"domains\":[\"sexkomix2.com\",\"*.sexkomix2.com\"],\"login\":null,\"domain\":\"sexkomix2.com\"},{\"id\":\"thehentai:all\",\"title\":\"TheHentai\",\"language\":\"all\",\"adult\":true,\"supported\":true,\"domains\":[\"thehentai.net\"],\"login\":null,\"domain\":\"thehentai.net\"},{\"id\":\"toomicssc:zh\",\"title\":\"TooMicsSc\",\"language\":\"zh\",\"adult\":false,\"supported\":true,\"domains\":[\"toomics.com\",\"*.toomics.com\"],\"login\":null,\"domain\":\"toomics.com\"},{\"id\":\"toomicstc:zh\",\"title\":\"TooMicsTc\",\"language\":\"zh\",\"adult\":false,\"supported\":true,\"domains\":[\"toomics.com\",\"*.toomics.com\"],\"login\":null,\"domain\":\"toomics.com\"},{\"id\":\"webtoons_zh:zh\",\"title\":\"Webtoons Chinese\",\"language\":\"zh\",\"adult\":false,\"supported\":true,\"domains\":[\"webtoons.com\",\"www.webtoons.com\",\"m.web